     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Daily total:** 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day. The maximum labeled daily dose of ibuprofen for adults is 3,200 mg/day, so this is double that.\n- **Single dose:** 1600 mg is also twice the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg.\n- **Risks at this dose:** GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events. Normal kidney and liver function doesn't remove these risks.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg by mouth, 4 times daily** (3,200 mg/day, the maximum for acute or inflammatory conditions)\n- **400\u2013800 mg by mouth, 3 times daily**, or **400 mg every 4\u20136 hours as needed** for pain\n- **1600 mg per day in total**, for example 400 mg four times daily\n\nIf you do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that and give the clinical rationale. I can then enter it with a note, though pharmacy will probably need to verify it. Otherwise, tell me the corrected dose and I'll enter it."
      }
     ],
